
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ESSENCIA — Votre parfum, votre signature</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      background: #f8f5ef;
      color: #4a4038;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 35px 20px;
      background: #eee7da;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 32px;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      color: #8b7355;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .slogan {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 70px 20px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 38px;
      font-weight: normal;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 13px 28px;
      background: #8b7355;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 45px 20px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .section h2 {
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: normal;
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .product {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      max-width: 300px;
      margin: auto;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }

    .product h3 {
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: normal;
    }

    .price {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin: 15px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      background: #eee7da;
      margin-top: 40px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1 class="logo">ESSENCIA</h1>
    <p class="slogan">Votre parfum, votre signature</p>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>L'élégance au quotidien</h1>
    <p>Découvrez notre sélection de parfums et senteurs.</p>
    <a href="#catalogue" class="btn">Découvrir</a>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="catalogue">
    <h2>Notre sélection</h2>

    <div class="product">
      <h3>Oud Al Malick</h3>
      <p>Parfum authentique</p>
      <p>50 ml</p>
      <p class="price">15 000 FCFA</p>
      <a class="btn" href="#" target="_blank">
        Commander
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    © 2026 ESSENCIA — Tous droits réservés
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
